  "note": "Capo 4 turns the record's G sharp minor into Em, C, D, G, Am and Bm. It is slow: strum softly or pick each chord one string at a time and let it ring. Mind the bars with two chords, C to D early in the verse and C to Am near its end. The guitar fills and solos are left out; their backing chords are charted.",
