  "remarks": "Sounds in G#m; chords are capo-4 shapes (one chart uses them). Four charts agree on the chords; none has bar lines, so the 16-bar verse and 8-bar bridge are worked out from 79 BPM and 7:00, a guess. Sus4 touches are left out. The first intro round is the free opening. Charts differ on bar 3 of the interludes.",
